{% comment %}
  Client work as the top of the home page.

  Built ahead of the images existing. Each slot needs both a URL and a credit
  before it renders, and if fewer than three are complete the whole gallery
  renders nothing — a photo lab's home page showing two photographs and a gap
  looks worse than one showing none, so the failure mode is absence.

  TO FILL THIS IN
  Upload the frames in Shopify admin under Content > Files, copy each CDN URL,
  and paste them below with the photographer's name. Get permission first and
  credit every frame — this section exists to show off their work as much as
  our scanning, and an uncredited client photograph is not a good look for a
  lab that wants more of them. Then enable the "Client work" section on the
  home page in the theme editor.

  Usage:
    {% render 'cfl-client-gallery' %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign img_1 = ''
  assign credit_1 = ''
  assign img_2 = ''
  assign credit_2 = ''
  assign img_3 = ''
  assign credit_3 = ''
  assign img_4 = ''
  assign credit_4 = ''
  assign img_5 = ''
  assign credit_5 = ''

  assign urls = img_1 | append: '~' | append: img_2 | append: '~' | append: img_3 | append: '~' | append: img_4 | append: '~' | append: img_5 | split: '~'
  assign credits = credit_1 | append: '~' | append: credit_2 | append: '~' | append: credit_3 | append: '~' | append: credit_4 | append: '~' | append: credit_5 | split: '~'

  assign ready = 0
  for u in urls
    assign c = credits[forloop.index0]
    if u != blank and c != blank
      assign ready = ready | plus: 1
    endif
  endfor
-%}

{%- if ready >= 3 -%}
  <section class="cfl-client-gallery" aria-labelledby="cfl-client-gallery-title">
    <div class="cfl-client-gallery__intro">
      <h2 class="cfl-section-heading" id="cfl-client-gallery-title">Shot on film, scanned by us</h2>
      <p class="cfl-section-intro">
        Work from photographers who send us their film. Every frame below came back from our
        scanners exactly as you see it.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ul class="cfl-client-gallery__grid" role="list">
      {%- for url in urls -%}
        {%- assign credit = credits[forloop.index0] -%}
        {%- if url != blank and credit != blank -%}
          <li class="cfl-client-frame">
            <figure>
              <img src="{{ url }}" alt="Photograph by {{ credit }}" loading="lazy" width="800" height="1200">
              <figcaption class="cfl-client-frame__credit">{{ credit }}</figcaption>
            </figure>
          </li>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ul>
  </section>
{%- endif -%}
